    "Hi {client}, if you enjoyed working together, a short testimonial (2 to 3 sentences) for my site would mean a lot. No pressure at all: only if it's easy." : {
      "comment" : "Example: testimonial",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hallo {client}, falls die Zusammenarbeit gut für dich war: Ich würde mich über eine kurze Empfehlung (2 bis 3 Sätze) für meine Website freuen. Kein Druck, nur wenn es einfach passt."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hi {client}, if you enjoyed working together, a short testimonial (2 to 3 sentences) for my site would mean a lot. No pressure at all: only if it's easy."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hola {client}, si disfrutaste trabajar conmigo, ¿podrías escribir una recomendación corta (2 o 3 oraciones) para mi sitio? Sin presión, solo si te resulta fácil."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "{client}様、一緒に取り組んだ時間が良いものでしたら、私のサイトに載せる短い推薦文(2、3文)をお願いできますか。無理のない範囲で、お手すきのときだけで構いません。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "안녕하세요 {client}님, 함께 작업한 경험이 좋으셨다면 제 사이트에 올릴 짧은 추천사(2-3문장) 부탁드려도 될까요. 부담 가지지 마시고, 간단히 가능하실 때만요."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
