    "The quick paste panel (⌃⇧V) stays over your current app, click a memo and the text is pasted directly into the text field you were typing in, without losing focus." : {
      "comment" : "Auto-registered",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Das Schnelleinfüge-Fenster (⌃⇧V) bleibt über deiner aktuellen App. Klicke auf einen Textbaustein, und der Text wird direkt in das Textfeld eingefügt, in dem du gerade schreibst, ohne den Fokus zu verlieren."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The quick paste panel (⌃⇧V) stays over your current app, click a snippet and the text is pasted directly into the text field you were typing in, without losing focus."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El panel de pegado rápido (⌃⇧V) se queda sobre tu app actual. Haz clic en una frase y el texto se pega directo en el campo donde estabas escribiendo, sin perder el foco."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "クイック貼り付けパネル(⌃⇧V)は現在のアプリの上に表示されます。定型文をクリックすると、入力中のテキスト欄にフォーカスを保ったまま直接貼り付けられます。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The quick paste panel (⌃⇧V) stays over your current app, click a memo and the text is pasted directly into the text field you were typing in, without losing focus."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Панель быстрой вставки (⌃⇧V) остаётся поверх текущего приложения, нажмите на фразу, и текст сразу вставится в то поле, где вы печатали, без потери фокуса."
          }
        },
        "th" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "แผงวางด่วน (⌃⇧V) จะอยู่เหนือแอปที่คุณใช้อยู่ คลิกโน้ตแล้วข้อความจะถูกวางลงในช่องที่คุณกำลังพิมพ์ทันที โดยไม่เสียโฟกัส"
          }
        },
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bảng dán nhanh (⌃⇧V) nằm trên ứng dụng bạn đang dùng. Nhấp vào một cụm từ và văn bản sẽ được dán thẳng vào ô bạn đang nhập, không mất tiêu điểm."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "快速粘贴面板（⌃⇧V）会浮在当前 App 上方，点一个短语，文字就直接粘到你刚才输入的文本框里，焦点不会丢。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "快速貼上面板（⌃⇧V）會浮在當前 App 上方，點一個短語，文字就直接貼到你剛才輸入的文字框裡，焦點不會丟。"
          }
        }
      }
