    "만들다 만 단축어만 임시저장, 열어만 봐도 쌓이던 문제 정리" : {
      "comment" : "Changelog 4.3.8 item 3",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nur Textbausteine mit echten Änderungen werden als Entwurf gesichert, kein Entwurfsstapel mehr"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Drafts only save when you actually made changes, no more draft pile-up"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Los borradores solo se guardan si hiciste cambios, y ya no se acumulan"
