    "이제 키보드에서 단축어를 바로 불러올 수 있어요.\n키보드를 열고 🌐를 길게 눌러 ClipKeyboard로 전환하세요." : {
      "comment" : "Setup done description",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Jetzt kannst du deine Textbausteine direkt über die Tastatur abrufen.\nÖffne die Tastatur und halte 🌐 gedrückt, um zu ClipKeyboard zu wechseln."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Now you can pull up your snippets right from the keyboard.\nOpen the keyboard and long-press 🌐 to switch to ClipKeyboard."
