      }
    },
    "카테고리가 저절로 늘어나지 않아요. 이제 직접 만드실 때만 생겨요" : {
      "comment" : "Changelog 5.0.6 category growth",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Kategorien vermehren sich nicht mehr von selbst. Sie entstehen nur, wenn du selbst eine anlegst"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Categories no longer multiply on their own. They grow only when you make one"
          }
