    "키보드에서 단축어를 길게 누르면 입력 대신 클립보드로 들어가요. 붙여넣을 곳이 따로 있을 때 쓰세요." : {
      "comment" : "DYK body: long press",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Halte einen Textbaustein auf der Tastatur gedrückt, dann landet er in der Zwischenablage statt im Text. Praktisch, wenn du woanders einfügen willst."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hold a snippet on the keyboard and it goes to the clipboard instead of being typed. Handy when you're pasting somewhere else."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
